        "text": "Dreamina AI Motion Studio is LIVE!\n\nDescribe your idea in a prompt and turn it into code-rendered motion graphics. Explore a range of style templates to start creating faster.\n\nSmarter structure. Clearer storytelling. \n‣ Organize your ideas, copy, and assets into a coherent narrative, with a clear structure and thoughtfully planned pacing.\n\nCode-driven animation. Precise control. \n‣ Fine-tune layouts, element entrances, and animation timing to guide attention and present each detail exactly as intended.\n\nReady-to-use styles. Faster creation. \n‣ Apply preset styles in one click, then refine your content, look, and pacing through follow-up prompts.\n\nSound and visuals. Designed together. \n‣ Combine text, images, and graphics into distinctive animations, with voiceover and music that complement the visual rhythm.\n\nFrom a written idea to polished motion graphics—create it all in Dreamina AI's Motion Studio.\n\n🕐 Limited-time offers:\n‣ Not a subscriber yet? Try Motion Studio free for 1 month.\n‣ Get credits at 40% off.\n \n🎁 Repost and comment within 12 hours of this post going live. The first 200 people to complete both will receive 1,000 Dreamina credits each. First come, first served.\n\n#DreaminaAI #DreaminaMotionStudio"
      },
